9
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.440
All right, we're still saying goodbye to Michael.
好了，我们还在告别迈克尔。

10
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:29.520
I know.
我知道。

11
00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.640
It's goodbye, Michael, part two.
这是《再见，迈克尔》的第二部分。

12
00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.440
This is the real deal goodbye.
这才是真正的告别。

13
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.280
This is the tearjerker.
这集会让人泪流满面。

14
00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:35.880
Yeah.
没错。

15
00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:40.540
