And when I Googled it, I did find a book on Amazon and it's got a photo of Michael Scott
上面还有一个金色的小贴纸，写着“斯克兰顿时报畅销书”。

146
00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:23.000
on the cover and he's in like a suit.
