That belonged to Steve.
那个位置属于史蒂夫。

1236
00:54:35.290 --> 00:54:39.990
And we made him a Dunder Mifflin hockey jersey with his number one on it.
我们还为他制作了一件印有他“一号”号码的邓德·米夫林冰球衫。

1237
00:54:40.050 --> 00:54:41.050
And the cast signed it.
演员们都在上面签了名。

1238
00:54:41.190 --> 00:54:45.130
I remember Randy brought it around to all of us in our trailers, and we all signed
我记得兰迪带着它到我们的拖车里，我们所有人都签了

1239
00:54:45.130 --> 00:54:45.530
to this.
名字。

1240
00:54:45.690 --> 00:54:48.990
And when Nancy was on the podcast, she shared that they had framed that.
南希上播客时分享说，他们把那件球衫装裱起来了。

1241
00:54:48.990 --> 00:54:50.330
And that's Steve's office.
就挂在史蒂夫的办公室里。

1242
00:54:50.590 --> 00:54:50.750
Yeah.
是啊。

1243
00:54:51.270 --> 00:54:52.170
It was really sweet.
那真的很温馨。

1244
00:54:52.850 --> 00:54:54.910
Well, we are at the end of this episode.
好了，这一集到这里就结束了。

1245
00:54:55.070 --> 00:55:00.030
And before we wrap it up, I thought I would bring out my last bit of digital clutter.
在结束之前，我想展示一下我最后一点数字杂物。

1246
00:55:00.430 --> 00:55:00.910
Woo-hoo!
呜呼！

1247
00:55:01.070 --> 00:55:01.390
Woo-hoo!
呜呼！

1248
00:55:01.650 --> 00:55:02.210
Digital clutter!
数字杂物！

1249
00:55:02.210 --> 00:55:02.710
Yes!
耶！

1250
00:55:03.050 --> 00:55:09.570
At this time, I would do little vignette videos for NBC.com and ventures with Angela, you guys,
当时，我会为 NBC.com 制作一些小短片，还有和安吉拉你们一起做的项目，

1251
00:55:09.770 --> 00:55:11.030
around the set.
在片场周围。

1252
00:55:11.230 --> 00:55:16.290
And a lot of fans had written in and asked if I would do a goodbye video with Steve.
很多粉丝写信问我能不能和史蒂夫拍一段告别视频。

1253
00:55:16.870 --> 00:55:19.930
And NBC.com gave me a flip camera.
NBC.com 给了我一台翻盖摄像机。

1254
00:55:20.110 --> 00:55:20.730
Do you remember those?
还记得那种摄像机吗？

1255
00:55:21.270 --> 00:55:24.890
And I went and filmed it, and I found it in my digital clutter.
我去拍了，后来在我的数字杂物里找到了它。

1256
00:55:24.890 --> 00:55:29.050
And I thought we should hear a little bit of this final goodbye with Steve.
我觉得我们应该听听这段和史蒂夫最后的告别。

1257
00:55:29.050 --> 00:55:30.370
Hi, Office fans.
嗨，《办公室》的粉丝们。

1258
00:55:30.650 --> 00:55:31.750
It's Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金赛。

1259
00:55:31.990 --> 00:55:36.290
I'm in my trailer, and this is Steve's last week on our show.
我现在在我的拖车里，这是史蒂夫在我们剧组的最后一周。

1260
00:55:37.550 --> 00:55:44.850
And we've all been pretty emotional this week as Michael Scott leaves Dunder Mifflin.
随着迈克尔·斯科特离开邓德·米夫林公司，我们这周都挺感伤的。

1261
00:55:44.850 --> 00:55:52.530
And, um, I have to say, there were some tears at our table read, and there were tears on set.
嗯，我得说，我们在剧本围读时流了一些泪，片场也流了泪。

1262
00:55:52.730 --> 00:55:58.690
And it's just been just sort of a very, you know, great week.
这周过得真的很棒，你知道的。

1263
00:55:59.450 --> 00:56:02.610
And we're happy, and we're sad, and we're all of it.
我们既开心又难过，各种情绪交织在一起。

1264
00:56:02.730 --> 00:56:06.710
And I just thought I would walk over to Steve's trailer now, and maybe we could all say goodbye.
我刚才想，不如走到史蒂夫的拖车那儿，也许我们能一起道个别。

1265
00:56:07.110 --> 00:56:08.790
Here we are at Steve's trailer.
我们现在到了史蒂夫的拖车前。

1266
00:56:09.330 --> 00:56:09.770
Steve?
史蒂夫？

1267
00:56:10.670 --> 00:56:11.470
It's Angela.
是我，安吉拉。

1268
00:56:12.770 --> 00:56:14.130
Hey, don't be afraid.
嘿，别怕。

1269
00:56:14.690 --> 00:56:15.630
Can I come in?
我能进去吗？

1270
00:56:15.730 --> 00:56:16.410
Can we say goodbye?
我们能道个别吗？

1271
00:56:17.230 --> 00:56:17.650
Okay.
好的。

1272
00:56:17.810 --> 00:56:19.870
Not me personally, but, you know, you're fans.
不是我个人，而是，你知道的，你们的粉丝。

1273
00:56:20.190 --> 00:56:20.530
Okay.
好的。

1274
00:56:20.750 --> 00:56:21.230
Come on in.
进来吧。

1275
00:56:21.470 --> 00:56:21.790
Okay.
好的。

1276
00:56:22.070 --> 00:56:26.070
So I just wanted to come here on behalf of all the fans of Michael Scott and of yours.
所以我只是想代表所有迈克尔·斯科特和你的粉丝来这里。

1277
00:56:26.070 --> 00:56:30.970
And, uh, is there anything you want to say to the fans as you, as your character departs
那个，在你，或者说你的角色离开这部剧的时候，

1278
00:56:30.970 --> 00:56:31.370
the show?
你有什么想对粉丝们说的吗？

1279
00:56:31.530 --> 00:56:32.730
Uh, I do, actually.
嗯，其实有的。

1280
00:56:33.030 --> 00:56:36.010
I've, I've made an enormous mistake.
我，我犯了一个巨大的错误。

1281
00:56:36.330 --> 00:56:37.250
Oh, no.
噢，别这样。

1282
00:56:37.350 --> 00:56:40.910
And I think that I probably shouldn't be going.
我觉得我可能不该走。

1283
00:56:42.570 --> 00:56:43.650
And, uh...
而且，呃……

1284
00:56:44.630 --> 00:56:46.950
You're going to have, like, zero job.
那你可就彻底失业了。

1285
00:56:47.850 --> 00:56:50.430
Um, I'm just, I'm really thankful.
嗯，我只是，我真的很感激。

1286
00:56:50.430 --> 00:56:54.390
I think we're all very thankful, uh, to have had the, the jobs.
我想我们大家都非常感激，呃，能拥有这份工作。

1287
00:56:54.390 --> 00:56:56.290
Uh, this is more than a job, really.
呃，这真的不仅仅是一份工作。

1288
00:56:56.570 --> 00:56:58.450
Um, and I think everybody here feels that way.
嗯，我想这里的每个人都有同感。

1289
00:56:58.670 --> 00:57:02.610
It's been not only fun, but I was talking to my wife about it.
这不仅很有趣，而且我跟我妻子聊过这件事。

1290
00:57:02.770 --> 00:57:04.990
And, and I've been pretty emotional the last couple of weeks, too.
过去几周我也一直挺感伤的。

1291
00:57:05.410 --> 00:57:07.190
And one of the things she pointed out,
她指出的其中一点是，

1292
00:57:07.370 --> 00:57:07.610
Yeah!
好嘞！

1293
00:57:08.690 --> 00:57:09.690
Okay, I'll be right out.
好的，我马上出来。

1294
00:57:09.690 --> 00:57:11.270
Uh, I'm filming my farewell.
呃，我正在拍我的告别视频。

1295
00:57:11.630 --> 00:57:12.530
We'll be right there.
我们马上就到。

1296
00:57:13.090 --> 00:57:18.570
Um, I think, uh, one of the things she said that I thought really hit the nail on the head
嗯，我想，呃，她说的一点我觉得真的说到了点子上，

1297
00:57:18.570 --> 00:57:22.710
was that it's a part that has kind of defined me professionally.
那就是这个角色在职业生涯上定义了我。

1298
00:57:23.190 --> 00:57:26.250
But on top of that, she said, these are your friends.
但除此之外，她说，这些人是你的朋友。

1299
00:57:26.250 --> 00:57:34.550
So that, to me, um, that, that to me is, is why, um, the, the show has been so important to me.
所以对我来说，嗯，那，那对我来说就是，嗯，这部剧对我如此重要的原因。

1300
00:57:34.690 --> 00:57:39.050
And the fact that people have watched it and enjoyed it, uh, over these years that I've been on it.
还有就是，在我参演的这些年里，人们一直观看并喜爱着它。

1301
00:57:39.190 --> 00:57:43.930
And we'll continue to enjoy it, because it remains and will continue to be a fantastic show.
我们会继续享受它，因为它依然是一部精彩的剧集，未来也依然会是。

1302
00:57:44.350 --> 00:57:44.650
Yay.
耶。

1303
00:57:45.990 --> 00:57:47.630
Look, Steve has to squinch down.
看，史蒂夫得缩着身子。

1304
00:57:47.870 --> 00:57:50.730
Okay, from Adventures with Angela, goodbye, Steve.
好了，来自《安吉拉历险记》，再见，史蒂夫。

1305
00:57:51.110 --> 00:57:51.770
We love you.
我们爱你。

1306
00:57:51.930 --> 00:57:52.890
We love you, Steve.
我们爱你，史蒂夫。

1307
00:57:52.890 --> 00:57:57.050
Aw, my favorite part is when Kelly Cantley knocks on the door.
噢，我最喜欢的部分是凯莉·坎特利敲门的时候。

1308
00:57:58.570 --> 00:58:01.210
Yeah, because it's still so real, right?
是啊，因为那依然很真实，对吧？

1309
00:58:01.210 --> 00:58:02.570
Yeah, that's what it was like.
没错，当时就是那样的。

1310
00:58:02.630 --> 00:58:06.190
You'd be having, like, this heart-to-heart with someone, and there'd be like this,
你正和某人推心置腹地交谈，然后就会有那种，

1311
00:58:06.530 --> 00:58:07.870
need you in five minutes.
五分钟后需要你。

1312
00:58:08.130 --> 00:58:09.190
Okay, okay.
好的，好的。

1313
00:58:09.490 --> 00:58:11.070
I'm just crying my heart out in here.
我还在里面哭得肝肠寸断呢。

1314
00:58:11.610 --> 00:58:12.810
It does take you back.
这确实让你回到了过去。

1315
00:58:12.970 --> 00:58:20.330
And it was such a, he's so right about how unique that show is in terms of the relationships of being,
而且这真是，他说得太对了，这部剧在人际关系方面是多么独特，

1316
00:58:20.330 --> 00:58:28.810
you know, seven years, nine years on the same lot with the same crew and the same actors.
你知道，在同一个片场，和同一批剧组人员及演员共事了七年、九年。

1317
00:58:29.290 --> 00:58:35.770
And, and I think also just the fact that it was a mockumentary and we had so much time
而且，我觉得仅仅因为它是伪纪录片，我们就有那么多时间

1318
00:58:35.770 --> 00:58:40.690
on set with each other as opposed to, you know, waiting for lighting and stuff.
在片场相处，而不是像往常那样等着打光之类的。

1319
00:58:40.870 --> 00:58:43.350
It was just a, it's very unusual experience.
这真是一种非常不寻常的经历。

1320
00:58:43.890 --> 00:58:48.870
Well, I love that Steve said, you know, well, I guess it's what Nancy and him had talked about,
嗯，我喜欢史蒂夫说的，你知道，嗯，我想这就是他和南希谈过的，

1321
00:58:49.010 --> 00:58:50.690
that the show was about friendship.
这部剧讲的是友谊。

1322
00:58:51.070 --> 00:58:55.370
And I, I think that's the beauty of it and that we still have that to this day.
而且，我觉得这就是它的美妙之处，直到今天我们依然拥有这份友谊。

1323
00:58:55.510 --> 00:59:00.770
I mean, this week, Jenna, we are on a text thread with the whole cast and we were texting back and forth.
我是说，这周，珍娜，我们和全体演员有个群聊，大家一直在发信息。

