If, if, if, if Yarn Man had stayed in, Yarn Man had lived.
如果，如果，如果，如果毛线人留下来了，毛线人就活下来了。

1329
00:59:08.610 --> 00:59:09.750
You would have been on that thread.
那你就会在那个群里了。

1330
00:59:09.950 --> 00:59:10.270
Exactly.
没错。

1331
00:59:11.350 --> 00:59:14.750
Well, Greg, thank you so much for joining us today.
好吧，格雷格，非常感谢你今天能来。

1332
00:59:15.130 --> 00:59:16.170
This was such a treat.
这真是一种享受。

1333
00:59:16.390 --> 00:59:17.550
It's my pleasure.
这是我的荣幸。

1334
00:59:17.770 --> 00:59:22.730
I love coming to do your show just to see you two guys and have fun chat.
我喜欢来上你们的节目，就为了见见你们俩，愉快地聊聊天。

1335
00:59:23.150 --> 00:59:25.350
And if they didn't record it, that'd be fine with me.
就算他们没录下来，我也没意见。

1336
00:59:25.670 --> 00:59:26.050
Aww.
噢。

1337
00:59:26.910 --> 00:59:28.390
Greg, you're just the beSt.
格雷格，你真是太棒了。

1338
00:59:28.570 --> 00:59:32.030
And you guys, thank you again for sending in your awesome questions.
还有你们大家，再次感谢你们发来这么棒的问题。

1339
00:59:32.050 --> 00:59:33.170
We loved them.
我们很喜欢。

